"style='display: block; font-weight: normal'>Quota:</label><input "
"type='text' id='users_set_quota' value='%(quota)s'></p><p><small>Quotas "
"may not contain any spaces or commas.  Suffixes of G (gigabytes) and M "
"(megabytes) are allowed.</small></p><p><small>For unlimited storage enter"
" 0 (zero)</small></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Définir le quota pour <b>%(email)s</b> ?</p><p><label "
"for='users_set_quota' style='display: block; font-weight: normal'>Quota "
":</label><input type='text' id='users_set_quota' "
"value='%(quota)s'></p><p><small>Les quotas ne doivent contenir ni espaces"
" ni virgules. Les suffixes G (gigaoctets) et M (mégaoctets) sont "
"autorisés.</small></p><p><small>Pour un stockage illimité, saisissez 0 "
"(zéro)</small></p>"

